``` Kerberoasting indicator: abnormal volume of RC4 (etype 0x17) service ticket requests per account in a short window ```
index=wineventlog EventCode=4769 Ticket_Encryption_Type=0x17
| bin _time span=15m
| stats count AS ticket_requests dc(Service_Name) AS unique_spns_requested BY Account_Name, _time
| where ticket_requests >= 10
| eval hunt_finding = "Suspected Kerberoasting — High-Volume RC4 Ticket Requests"
| eval mitre = "T1558.003"
| sort - ticket_requests

``` LSASS process access from a non-allowlisted process (see sentinel-queries/lsass_credential_dumping.kql for the EDR/Defender equivalent) ```
index=sysmon EventCode=10 TargetImage="*\\lsass.exe"
| where NOT match(SourceImage, "(?i)(MsMpEng\.exe|Taniium\.exe|crowdstrike|sentinelone|cbdefense)")
| where match(GrantedAccess, "0x1[0-9a-fA-F]{3}") ``` narrow to access masks commonly used by dumping tools ```
| table _time Computer SourceImage TargetImage GrantedAccess
| eval hunt_finding = "Suspicious LSASS Access"
| eval mitre = "T1003.001"
